MODULE: themes/service
FILES: app/services/theme.py
RESPONSIBILITY: 题材业务逻辑编排
KEY_FILES:
- app/services/theme.py: ThemeService 类，约 203 行
DEPENDENCIES:
- imports: app.repositories.theme: ThemeRepository 数据访问
- imports: app.schemas.theme: 响应模型
INTERFACES:
- ThemeService(session: AsyncSession): 题材服务
- list_themes(page, page_size, sort_by, sort_order, category, tags) -> ThemeListResponse: 列表查询
- get_theme_detail(theme_id) -> ThemeDetailResponse: 详情查询（含产业链分组）
- search_themes(query, page, page_size) -> ThemeListResponse: 搜索
- get_categories() -> ThemeCategoriesResponse: 分类列表
- get_ranking(limit) -> ThemeRankingResponse: 排名
- get_theme_stocks(theme_id, chain_level, page, page_size) -> StockListResponse: 题材关联股票查询
TRAPS:
- [LOW] get_theme_detail 按 level 分组产业链 — 仅支持 upstream/midstream/downstream，其他 level 值会被忽略
